flowchart LR
  client[REST client] --> api[Express API]
  api --> ingress[Shared ingress and endpoint limits]
  ingress --> redis[(Redis)]
  ingress --> http[Controllers and Zod]
  http --> identity[Identity / MFA / authorization services]
  http --> bookings[Availability / booking / cancellation services]
  http --> directory[Doctor discovery service]
  identity --> tx[Transaction-scoped repositories]
  bookings --> tx
  tx --> pg[(PostgreSQL core / identity / outbox)]
  directory --> snapshot[Directory query and generation snapshot]
  snapshot --> pg
  directory --> cache[Public metadata cache: TTL 30s / DB generation]
  cache --> redis
  pg --> revision[Transactional doctor/account revision triggers]
  identity --> crypto[Argon2id / EdDSA / AES-GCM / TOTP]
  keys[Injected application keys] --> crypto
  root[Constructor composition root] --> identity
  root --> bookings
  root --> directory
  api --> health[Health / request IDs / redacted logs]
  operator[Trusted operator CLI] --> identity
  migrator[Owner SQL migrator] --> pg
  worker[Durable worker: leases / fencing / receipts] --> pg
  worker --> redis
  worker --> jobs[Internal compensation / fake refund boundary]
  jobs --> pg
  maintenance[Restricted scheduled maintenance] --> pg
  operator --> manual[Audited manual setup delivery]
  http --> clinical[Encrypted notes / prescription versions / payments / admin]
  clinical --> tx
  api --> telemetry[Allowlisted OTLP spans and metrics]
  worker --> telemetry
  telemetry --> collector[OTel collector]
  collector --> prom[Prometheus and alerts]
  collector --> tempo[Tempo traces]
  prom --> grafana[Grafana dashboards]
  tempo --> grafana
  github[GitHub CI / approved OIDC deployment] --> ecs[Private ECS API / worker + RDS Multi-AZ + cache]
  ecs -. undeployed cloud configuration .-> api
